## Purpose

Beacon delivery separates untrusted change creation from trusted promotion. A feature branch can propose code, documentation, policy, or workflow changes. It cannot deploy production. Pull-request gates create evidence, a protected main branch establishes the release boundary, and environment-gated workflows promote the exact tested archive.

